==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|honest|ly|lang=en}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# {{context|manner|lang=en}} In an [[honest]] manner.
#: ''He answered the questions '''honestly'''.''
# {{context|speech act|lang=en}} [[frankly|Frankly]].
#: '''''Honestly''', I didn't believe a word she said.''

